      "When total pending hints exceed 512, queued entries are ignored and each lane runs the same pendingHints warp loop as control. pendingHints is not consumed while populating queueBits, so fallback retains the complete set.",
      "Inactive threads in a partial last block skip raw selection, contribute zero pending hints, may help resolve active owners, participate in both barriers, and continue before any owner-state prefix access. Queued owner ids can only come from active threads.",
